{"version":1,"content":"<p>日本防災廳今（2日）日正式成立，由首相高市早苗領導，並由她第一把手、復興相細野豪志出任第一任防災相。</p><p>防災廳負責統籌跨部門災害對策，重點應對南海海槽大地震及首都直下型地震等「國難級」災害。</p>","scraped_at":"2026-11-02T11:41:06.107635+00:00","quality":{"score":0,"chars":94,"images":0,"source":"明報 國際","fallback":"rss-blocked","origin":"rss","completeness":"unverified"},"published_at":"2026-11-02T10:58:53+00:00","fetched_at":"2026-11-02T11:38:11.529705+00:00","content_updated_at":"2026-11-02T11:38:11.529705+00:00","content_hash":"6b6050ad7a59fe30fbe01e1c24d3d223289821ff224cbd906e2059bc1237dd4e","evidence_status":"partial","scrape_error":"HTTP 403","content_retention":null,"content_capture":null}